  m_Name: Order_D-5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BilgiAdasi::BilgiAdasi.Order.OrderTask
  taskId: D-5
  title: "G\xFCbre Ruhu"
  residentName: "\xC7ift\xE7i Elif"
  requestLine: "D\xF6rt kavanoz g\xFCbre ruhu istiyorum, ne eksik ne fazla. Paras\u0131n\u0131
    pe\u015Fin veriyorum: kesede yirmi ak\xE7e. Artan\u0131n hesab\u0131 senin cebinden."
  reminderLine: "D\xF6rt kavanoz, \xE7\u0131rak. Sand\u0131ktan almadan \xF6nce hesab\u0131n\u0131
    yap."
  deliverLine: "D\xF6rt kavanoz, tastamam. Hesab\u0131n\u0131 bilen simyac\u0131!"
  afterLine: "Tarla ye\u015Ferdi! Hasatta seni de \xE7a\u011F\u0131raca\u011F\u0131m."
  hint: "\xD6nce bir kavanozluk denklemi kur, sonra ikiye katla."
  realLife: "Amonyak en \xE7ok \xFCretilen g\xFCbre hammaddelerindendir; keskin kokulu,
    zararl\u0131 bir gazd\u0131r ve kapal\u0131 fabrikalarda \xFCretilir."
  reasoning:
    question: "Fazladan ald\u0131\u011F\u0131n N<sub>2</sub> olsayd\u0131 neden kazanda
      kal\u0131rd\u0131?"
    options:
    - "H<sub>2</sub> biterdi; N<sub>2</sub> e\u015Fle\u015Fecek hidrojen bulamaz,
      tepkime dururdu."
    - "Kazan dolar, s\u0131\u011Fmazd\u0131."
    - "N<sub>2</sub> a\u011F\u0131r oldu\u011Fu i\xE7in dibe \xE7\xF6ker, kar\u0131\u015Fmazd\u0131."
    correctIndex: 0
    replies:
    - "Aynen \xF6yle. Biri biterse tepkime durur, fazla olan artar."
    - "Hacim de\u011Fil, say\u0131 meselesi. Hidrojen biterse azot e\u015Fsiz kal\u0131r."
    - "Kar\u0131\u015Fmak tepkimeye girmek demek de\u011Fil. Azot e\u015Fle\u015Fecek
      hidrojen bulamad\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\xE7in artar."
  discoveryId: K-5
  discoveryText: "Tepkime girenleri katsay\u0131lar\u0131 oran\u0131nda harcar. Biri
    biterse tepkime durur; fazla olan artar."
  mode: 1
  steps:
  - reaction: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e720008e0ba2fe844b431ad346b2e904, type: 2}
